cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AtmoViz"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Atmo Viz is a browser-based tool for exploring geolocated environmental measurements
  (temperature, humidity, pressure, VOC, particulate matter, air quality score) recorded
  along a route. It replays the route on a map with a time-travel timeline, evaluates every
  metric against health thresholds for four risk profiles, overlays geotagged FLIR thermal
  photos, and exports a PDF report. All processing happens in the browser.
